<title>UK: POLL-Robert Fleming tops Latam research - Extel.</title>
<headline>POLL-Robert Fleming tops Latam research - Extel.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert Fleming Securities is the top Latin America research house according to the 1997 Extel survey of investment analysts, weighted by size of funds managed by the firms which voted for them.</p>
<p>Rankings</p>
<p>1. Robert Fleming Securities</p>
<p>2. Merrill Lynch</p>
<p>3. Bear Stearns</p>
<p>4. ING Barings</p>
<p>5. Dresdner Kleinwort Benson</p>
<p>- London newsroom +171 542 2734</p>
